  "definition": "Dealer Plates on Trucks on Loan for Service Purposes",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-01-29",
  "historyNote": "#8966, eff 8-23-07 (from Saf-C 2003.08); ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
